'''Off-hand equipment''' is a sub-category of [[equipment]] that are equipped in the off-hand slot (right weapon slot), typically alongside other [[weapon]]s, to provide offensive or defensive benefits through [[affix|modifiers]].

* [[Quiver]]s can only be equipped while holding a [[bow]].
* [[Shield]]s can be equipped while [[unarmed]] or with [[one-handed weapon]]s.

